{"lesson":{"id":"completer_carre","title":"Compléter le carré de x² + 6x − 7 et lire le sommet","language":"fr","learning_goal":"Transformer x² + 6x − 7 en (x + 3)² − 16 en complétant le carré, puis lire le sommet S(−3 ; −16) de la parabole."},"math_context":{"symbols":{},"expressions":{}}}
{"slice":{"slice_id":"s_presque","introduces":[{"id":"expr","type":"math","content":"x^2 + 6x - 7","parts":[{"id":"deux_termes","text":"x^2 + 6x"},{"id":"const","text":"- 7"}]},{"id":"carre_x","type":"polygon","params":{"vertices":[[0,0],[4,0],[4,4],[0,4]]},"style":{"role":"neutral"}},{"id":"lab_x2","type":"label","content":"x^2","attachment":{"parent":"carre_x","anchor":"center"}},{"id":"rect_6x","type":"polygon","params":{"vertices":[[4,0],[10,0],[10,4],[4,4]]},"style":{"role":"neutral"}},{"id":"lab_6x","type":"label","content":"6x","attachment":{"parent":"rect_6x","anchor":"center"}},{"id":"formule_carre","type":"math","content":"(x + a)^2 = x^2 + 2ax + a^2","parts":[{"id":"gauche","text":"(x + a)^2"},{"id":"eg","text":"="},{"id":"droite","text":"x^2 + 2ax + a^2"}]},{"id":"eq_2a","type":"math","content":"2a = 6"},{"id":"eq_a","type":"math","content":"\\Rightarrow a = 3"}],"groups":[{"id":"fig_carre","items":["carre_x","rect_6x"],"arrange":{"direction":"right","gap":"xs"}},{"id":"calc_a","items":["eq_2a","eq_a"],"arrange":{"direction":"down","align":"left"}}],"beats":[{"id":"b1","say":"On veut compléter le carré de x x au carré plus six x moins sept. Commençons par regarder seulement les deux premiers termes, x au carré plus six x.","cues":[{"id":"c_expr","text":"x x au carré plus six x moins sept"},{"id":"c_deux","text":"deux premiers termes"},{"id":"c_6x","text":"x au carré plus six x","occurrence":2}],"do":[{"id":"w_expr","verb":"write","target":"expr","at":"cue:c_expr"},{"id":"h_expr","verb":"highlight","target":"expr","part":"deux_termes","role":"secondary","start":"cue:c_deux","end":"cue_end:c_6x"}]},{"id":"b2","say":"Pense à un carré de côté x, et à côté, une bande de rectangle d'aire six x. Ce n'est pas encore un carré parfait.","cues":[{"id":"c_cote_x","text":"carré de côté x"},{"id":"c_bande","text":"bande de rectangle d'aire six x"},{"id":"c_pas","text":"pas encore un carré parfait"}],"do":[{"id":"d_carre","verb":"draw","target":"carre_x","at":"cue:c_cote_x"},{"id":"s_lab_x2","verb":"show","target":"lab_x2","at":"after:d_carre"},{"id":"d_rect","verb":"draw","target":"rect_6x","at":"cue:c_bande"},{"id":"s_lab_6x","verb":"show","target":"lab_6x","at":"after:d_rect"},{"id":"h_expr2","verb":"highlight","target":"expr","part":"deux_termes","role":"accent","start":"cue:c_pas","end":"cue_end:c_pas"}]},{"id":"b3","say":"Pourquoi presque ? Parce qu'un carré parfait s'écrit x plus quelque chose, le tout au carré, et il contient deux fois ce quelque chose en x.","cues":[{"id":"c_pourquoi","text":"Pourquoi presque"},{"id":"c_carre_parfait","text":"carré parfait s'écrit"},{"id":"c_deux_fois","text":"deux fois ce quelque chose"}],"do":[{"id":"w_gauche","verb":"write","target":"formule_carre","part":"gauche","at":"cue:c_carre_parfait"},{"id":"w_eg","verb":"write","target":"formule_carre","part":"eg","at":"after:w_gauche"},{"id":"w_droite","verb":"write","target":"formule_carre","part":"droite","at":"cue:c_deux_fois"}]},{"id":"b4","say":"Ici, le double produit vaut six x. Donc deux a égale six, et a égale trois.","cues":[{"id":"c_double","text":"double produit vaut six x"},{"id":"c_2a","text":"deux a égale six"},{"id":"c_a3","text":"a égale trois"}],"do":[{"id":"w_2a","verb":"write","target":"eq_2a","at":"cue:c_2a"},{"id":"w_a","verb":"write","target":"eq_a","at":"cue:c_a3"},{"id":"h_droite","verb":"highlight","target":"formule_carre","part":"droite","role":"accent","start":"cue:c_double","end":"cue_end:c_double"}]}]}}
{"slice":{"slice_id":"s_coin","introduces":[{"id":"rect_droite","type":"polygon","params":{"vertices":[[4,0],[7,0],[7,4],[4,4]]},"style":{"role":"accent"}},{"id":"lab_3x_d","type":"label","content":"3x","attachment":{"parent":"rect_droite","anchor":"center"}},{"id":"rect_bas","type":"polygon","params":{"vertices":[[0,-3],[4,-3],[4,0],[0,0]]},"style":{"role":"accent"}},{"id":"lab_3x_b","type":"label","content":"3x","attachment":{"parent":"rect_bas","anchor":"center"}},{"id":"coin","type":"polygon","params":{"vertices":[[4,-3],[7,-3],[7,0],[4,0]]},"style":{"role":"given"}},{"id":"lab_coin","type":"label","content":"9","attachment":{"parent":"coin","anchor":"center"}},{"id":"somme_carre","type":"math","content":"x^2 + 6x + 9 = (x + 3)^2","parts":[{"id":"gauche","text":"x^2 + 6x + 9"},{"id":"eg","text":"="},{"id":"droite","text":"(x + 3)^2"}]},{"id":"ajout_retrait","type":"math","content":"x^2 + 6x = (x + 3)^2 - 9","parts":[{"id":"gauche","text":"x^2 + 6x"},{"id":"eg","text":"="},{"id":"droite","text":"(x + 3)^2 - 9"}]},{"id":"moitie","type":"math","content":"\\frac{6}{2} = 3"},{"id":"carre_moitie","type":"math","content":"3^2 = 9"},{"id":"six","type":"math","content":"6"}],"groups":[{"id":"calc_moitie","items":["moitie","carre_moitie"],"arrange":{"direction":"down","align":"left"}}],"beats":[{"id":"b1","say":"La bande six x, je la coupe en deux bandes de trois x. Une reste à droite, l'autre descend en dessous du carré.","cues":[{"id":"c_coupe","text":"je la coupe en deux bandes de trois x"},{"id":"c_droite","text":"Une reste à droite"},{"id":"c_dessous","text":"l'autre descend en dessous du carré"}],"do":[{"id":"f_rect","verb":"fade_out","target":"rect_6x","at":"cue:c_coupe"},{"id":"d_rect_d","verb":"draw","target":"rect_droite","at":"cue:c_droite"},{"id":"s_lab_3x_d","verb":"show","target":"lab_3x_d","at":"after:d_rect_d"},{"id":"d_rect_b","verb":"draw","target":"rect_bas","at":"cue:c_dessous"},{"id":"s_lab_3x_b","verb":"show","target":"lab_3x_b","at":"after:d_rect_b"}]},{"id":"b2","say":"Maintenant il manque juste le petit coin, en bas à droite. Ce coin mesure trois par trois, donc neuf.","cues":[{"id":"c_coin","text":"petit coin, en bas à droite"},{"id":"c_trois","text":"trois par trois"},{"id":"c_neuf","text":"donc neuf"}],"do":[{"id":"d_coin","verb":"draw","target":"coin","at":"cue:c_coin"},{"id":"s_lab_coin","verb":"show","target":"lab_coin","at":"cue:c_neuf"}]},{"id":"b3","say":"Donc x au carré plus six x, plus neuf, c'est exactement x plus trois, le tout au carré.","cues":[{"id":"c_somme","text":"x au carré plus six x, plus neuf"},{"id":"c_exact","text":"exactement"},{"id":"c_x3carre","text":"x plus trois, le tout au carré"}],"do":[{"id":"w_g1","verb":"write","target":"somme_carre","part":"gauche","at":"cue:c_somme"},{"id":"w_eg1","verb":"write","target":"somme_carre","part":"eg","at":"cue:c_exact"},{"id":"w_d1","verb":"write","target":"somme_carre","part":"droite","at":"cue:c_x3carre"}]},{"id":"b4","say":"Mais je ne peux pas ajouter neuf comme ça, sans rien faire. Alors je l'ajoute ET je le retire en même temps : ça revient à ajouter zéro.","cues":[{"id":"c_ajouter","text":"pas ajouter neuf comme ça"},{"id":"c_retire","text":"je le retire"},{"id":"c_zero","text":"ajouter zéro"}],"do":[{"id":"w_g2","verb":"write","target":"ajout_retrait","part":"gauche","at":"cue:c_ajouter"},{"id":"w_eg2","verb":"write","target":"ajout_retrait","part":"eg","at":"after:w_g2"},{"id":"w_d2","verb":"write","target":"ajout_retrait","part":"droite","at":"cue:c_zero"}]},{"id":"b5","say":"Retiens bien : on ajoute le carré de la moitié du coefficient. La moitié de six, c'est trois, et son carré, c'est neuf.","cues":[{"id":"c_retiens","text":"Retiens bien"},{"id":"c_moitie","text":"moitié de six, c'est trois"},{"id":"c_soncarre","text":"son carré, c'est neuf"}],"do":[{"id":"w_moitie","verb":"write","target":"moitie","at":"cue:c_moitie"},{"id":"w_carre","verb":"write","target":"carre_moitie","at":"cue:c_soncarre"}]}]}}
{"slice":{"slice_id":"s_complet","introduces":[{"id":"etape_mid","type":"math","content":"(x+3)^2 - 9 - 7"},{"id":"canonique","type":"math","content":"(x + 3)^2 - 16","parts":[{"id":"carre","text":"(x + 3)^2"},{"id":"const","text":"- 16"}]},{"id":"verif","type":"math","content":"(x+3)^2 - 16 = x^2 + 6x + 9 - 16 = x^2 + 6x - 7"}],"beats":[{"id":"b1","say":"Maintenant je n'oublie pas le moins sept de départ. Je remplace x au carré plus six x par sa nouvelle forme, puis je ramasse les constantes.","cues":[{"id":"c_moins7","text":"moins sept de départ"},{"id":"c_remplace","text":"Je remplace x au carré plus six x"},{"id":"c_ramasse","text":"je ramasse les constantes"}],"do":[{"id":"s_expr","verb":"show","target":"expr","at":"cue:c_moins7"},{"id":"t_mid","verb":"transform","source":"expr","target":"etape_mid","at":"cue:c_remplace"}]},{"id":"b2","say":"Moins neuf moins sept, ça fait moins seize. La forme canonique est donc x plus trois, le tout au carré, moins seize.","cues":[{"id":"c_159","text":"Moins neuf moins sept, ça fait moins seize"},{"id":"c_x3","text":"x plus trois, le tout au carré"},{"id":"c_moins16","text":"moins seize","occurrence":2}],"do":[{"id":"t_canon","verb":"transform","source":"etape_mid","target":"canonique","at":"cue:c_159"},{"id":"h_canon","verb":"highlight","target":"canonique","role":"result","start":"cue:c_moins16","end":"cue_end:c_moins16"}]},{"id":"b3","say":"Vérifions en redéveloppant : x plus trois au carré donne x carré plus six x plus neuf, puis moins seize donne x carré plus six x moins sept. On retrouve bien le départ.","cues":[{"id":"c_verif","text":"Vérifions en redéveloppant"},{"id":"c_developpe","text":"x plus trois au carré donne x carré plus six x plus neuf"},{"id":"c_retrouve","text":"On retrouve bien le départ"}],"do":[{"id":"w_verif","verb":"write","target":"verif","at":"cue:c_verif"},{"id":"h_verif","verb":"highlight","target":"verif","role":"accent","start":"cue:c_developpe","end":"cue_end:c_retrouve"}]}]}}
{"slice":{"slice_id":"s_sommet","introduces":[{"id":"axe","type":"axes","params":{"x":[-8,2],"y":[-18,4]}},{"id":"parabole","type":"function_graph","params":{"expression":"x^2 + 6*x - 7","domain":[-8,2]},"style":{"role":"accent"}},{"id":"vert","type":"line","params":{"from":[-3,-18],"to":[-3,4]}},{"id":"lab_vert","type":"label","content":"x = -3","attachment":{"parent":"vert","anchor":"top"}},{"id":"zero1","type":"point","params":{"at":[-7,0]}},{"id":"zero1_lab","type":"label","content":"-7","attachment":{"parent":"zero1","anchor":"bottom"}},{"id":"zero2","type":"point","params":{"at":[1,0]}},{"id":"zero2_lab","type":"label","content":"1","attachment":{"parent":"zero2","anchor":"bottom"}},{"id":"sommet","type":"point","params":{"at":[-3,-16]},"style":{"role":"result"}},{"id":"sommet_lab","type":"label","content":"S(-3 ; -16)","attachment":{"parent":"sommet","anchor":"bottom"},"style":{"role":"result"}},{"id":"forme_generale","type":"math","content":"f(x) = a(x - h)^2 + k","parts":[{"id":"f","text":"f(x) ="},{"id":"a","text":"a"},{"id":"xh","text":"(x - h)^2"},{"id":"k","text":"+ k"}]},{"id":"corresp","type":"math","content":"a = 1,\\ h = -3,\\ k = -16","parts":[{"id":"ca","text":"a = 1"},{"id":"ch","text":"h = -3"},{"id":"ck","text":"k = -16"}]}],"groups":[{"id":"grp_corresp","items":["forme_generale","corresp"],"arrange":{"direction":"down","align":"left"}}],"beats":[{"id":"b1","say":"Cette forme canonique, x moins moins trois, le tout au carré, moins seize, se lit comme a fois x moins h au carré plus k.","cues":[{"id":"c_canonique","text":"Cette forme canonique"},{"id":"c_lit","text":"se lit comme"}],"do":[{"id":"h_canon","verb":"highlight","target":"canonique","role":"accent","start":"cue:c_canonique","end":"cue_end:c_canonique"},{"id":"w_f","verb":"write","target":"forme_generale","part":"f","at":"cue:c_lit"},{"id":"w_a","verb":"write","target":"forme_generale","part":"a","at":"after:w_f"},{"id":"w_xh","verb":"write","target":"forme_generale","part":"xh","at":"a