n minimum.","cues":[{"id":"c_hauteur","text":"c'est la hauteur du sommet"},{"id":"c_descend","text":"descend jusqu'à cette valeur"},{"id":"c_positif","text":"le a est positif"},{"id":"c_minimum","text":"c'est un minimum"}],"do":[{"id":"h_sommet","verb":"highlight","target":"sommet","role":"result","start":"cue:c_hauteur","end":"cue_end:c_descend"},{"id":"h_a","verb":"highlight","target":"corresp","part":"ca","role":"accent","start":"cue:c_positif","end":"cue_end:c_positif"}]}]}}
{"slice":{"slice_id":"s_recap","introduces":[{"id":"regle","type":"math","content":"x^2 + 6x - 7 = (x + 3)^2 - 16","parts":[{"id":"gauche","text":"x^2 + 6x - 7"},{"id":"eg","text":"="},{"id":"droite","text":"(x + 3)^2 - 16"}]}],"groups":[{"id":"recap","items":["regle","sommet_lab"],"arrange":{"direction":"down","align":"left"}}],"beats":[{"id":"b1","say":"En résumé, compléter le carré, c'est ajouter et retirer le carré de la moitié du coefficient de x, ici neuf, pour obtenir x plus trois au carré moins seize.","cues":[{"id":"c_resume","text":"En résumé"},{"id":"c_completer","text":"compléter le carré"},{"id":"c_obtenir","text":"x plus trois au carré moins seize"}],"do":[{"id":"f_axe","verb":"fade_out","target":"axe","at":"cue:c_resume"},{"id":"f_generale","verb":"fade_out","target":"forme_generale","at":"cue:c_resume"},{"id":"f_corresp","verb":"fade_out","target":"corresp","at":"cue:c_resume"},{"id":"w_g","verb":"write","target":"regle","part":"gauche","at":"cue:c_completer"},{"id":"w_e","verb":"write","target":"regle","part":"eg","at":"after:w_g"},{"id":"w_d","verb":"write","target":"regle","part":"droite","at":"cue:c_obtenir"}]},{"id":"b2","say":"Et cette forme est là pour une raison simple : elle affiche directement le sommet. Tu lis h égale moins trois, k égale moins seize, donc le sommet est S moins trois, moins seize.","cues":[{"id":"c_raison","text":"elle affiche directement le sommet"},{"id":"c_S","text":"S moins trois, moins seize","occurrence":2}],"do":[{"id":"h_regle","verb":"highlight","target":"regle","role":"result","start":"cue:c_raison","end":"cue_end:c_raison"},{"id":"h_sommet","verb":"highlight","target":"sommet","role":"result","start":"cue:c_S","end":"cue_end:c_S"}]}]}}
